{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2516940/extras/ezgif.com-video-to-gif-converted__2_.gif?t=1741894054\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>\u200eThe August Before</i> is a meditative narrative 3D puzzle about cleaning up, sorting out and packing up your life before moving on. In Chapter One, play through the first snippets of the story and get acquainted with your room, and the people in your life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Teenage love, first losses, and notes from friends are scattered in the corners: explore the details of the heroine's life, pack up the life you will take with you, and say goodbye - if you can.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2516940/extras/ezgif.com-video-to-gif-converted__1_.gif?t=1741894054\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">And remember - you can't take the past with you. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">All is well that ends well \u2014 and all is well that ends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2516940/extras/ezgif.com-video-to-gif-converter__2_.gif?t=1741894054\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2516940/extras/packyourlife3.gif?t=1741894054\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Clean up the room before leaving, find the necessary items, and pack them in a suitcase. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Keep track of the diary, change the music, arrange the objects, and try to remember not to disturb the dark corners of the room.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2516940/extras/brish_3.gif?t=1741894054\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Sort through the items and appreciate the resulting order and the details of the story that unfolds in the process.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2516940/extras/tweak_3.gif?t=1741894054\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore the chaos and enjoy your freedom to drag, erase, disassemble, break, and fix things in the highly interactive space.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2516940/extras/ezgif.com-video-to-gif-converter__2_.gif?t=1741894054\" /></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Better with music","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2516940/b9998dbb6d8d47b08ebdbebe493aac6ecde6cba3.jpg"},{"name":"End of playlist","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2516940/dcc14a0264a3143ff0954f57662057b62f8e661b.jpg"},{"name":"Bye, sweet friend","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2516940/6b3cec34d33a9d2c187c84d4a8ee21703fde295c.jpg"},{"name":"What if I stayed?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2516940/dba807319a232799d111f0de425c3b7b9d349419.jpg"},{"name":"All of them","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2516940/20c7f0a4ce3128b104bf2148db5be8f811048199.jpg"},{"name":"Dust off the past","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2516940/f973eaa436fc3209ffdd53ec03a66bcfe9e239d9.jpg"},{"name":"Star Gazer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommuni